o era","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":42340,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T16:25:15-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"16:25:15","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"A gente queria o amor que temos agora mas estávamos longe de ter","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":42341,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T16:32:00-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"16:32:00","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"","type":"image","is_edited":false,"attachment":"00042492-PHOTO-2025-01-26- 16-32-00.jpg","urls":[]},{"id":42342,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T16:32:09-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"16:32:09","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"As vezes acho que nada é suficiente tb","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":42343,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T18:26:52-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"18:26:52","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"Que ta fazendo?","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":42344,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T18:35:23-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"18:35:23","sender":"DV","content":"","type":"image","is_edited":false,"attachment":"00042495-PHOTO-2025-01-26-18-35- 23.jpg","urls":[]},{"id":42345,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T18:35:32-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"18:35:32","sender":"DV","content":"E vc","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":42346,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T18:41:28-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"18:41:28","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"Em casa com Aya","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":42347,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T18:42:32-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"18:42:32","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"To tristinha","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":42348,"timestamp":"2025-01-26T18:42:41-03:00","date":"2025-01-26","time":"18:42:41","sender":"DV","content":"Eu tb","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":42349,"timestamp":"2025-01-26